guide forever/class/mage/teleports-horde
title Teleports and Portals (Horde)
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
faction Horde
levels 20-50
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Teleport, Portal, Teleport: Orgrimmar, Teleport: Undercity, Teleport: Thunder Bluff, Portal: Orgrimmar, Portal: Undercity, Portal: Thunder Bluff, Thuul, Lexington Mortaim, Birgitte Cranston, Portal Trainer, Rune of Teleportation, Rune of Portals, reagent vendor, Mage, class spell
reward spell 3567 "Teleport: Orgrimmar"
reward spell 3563 "Teleport: Undercity"
reward spell 3566 "Teleport: Thunder Bluff"
