why Your city teleports at 20 and 30 and the group portals at 40 and 50, from each city's portal trainer.

# No quest: the Horde mage teleports and portals are trained, each city's
# from that city's Portal Trainer (Forever's trainer data, forever-tdb
# trainer_spell/creature_trainer: trainers 1005958 Thuul, 1002492 Lexington
# Mortaim, 1005957 Birgitte Cranston teach only their own city's two spells;
# the class trainers teach none of them):
# - Teleport: Orgrimmar (3567) and Teleport: Undercity (3563): level 20, 20s each.
# - Teleport: Thunder Bluff (3566): level 30, 80s.
# - Portal: Orgrimmar (11417) and Portal: Undercity (11418): level 40, 1g50s each.
# - Portal: Thunder Bluff (11420): level 50, 3g20s.
# Reagents (client item data, BuyPrice): Rune of Teleportation (17031) 10s,
# Rune of Portals (17032) 20s, from every capital's reagent vendor (items.json
# vendors: Hannah Akeley and Thomas Mordan in the Undercity, Horthus, Hagrus
# and Magenius in Orgrimmar, Chepi in Thunder Bluff).
# Teleport: Dalaran (1297659) in Forever's client spell book is untrained in
# Forever's data and listed as Alliance; see teleports-alliance.

step Teleport: Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20 go to Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, where the mage trainers live. Thuul, the portal trainer, stands on the upper floor and teaches Teleport: Orgrimmar for 20 silver. Every teleport burns one Rune of Teleportation (10 silver at any reagent vendor), so carry a few.
  level 20
  money 30s
  train 5958                                  -- Thuul: Teleport: Orgrimmar
  buy 17031 x5 nearest                        -- Rune of Teleportation, 10s each

step Teleport: Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar's gate to Tirisfal Glades and walk into the Undercity. Lexington Mortaim, the portal trainer, stands in the Magic Quarter with the mage trainers: Teleport: Undercity, 20 silver. Hannah Akeley beside him sells the runes.
  money 20s
  train 2492                                  -- Lexington Mortaim: Teleport: Undercity

step Teleport: Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 30. Thunder Bluff is in Mulgore: fly there from Orgrimmar or the Crossroads. Birgitte Cranston, the portal trainer, stands with the mage trainers in the Pools of Vision, the cave under Spirit Rise: go down inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. She teaches Teleport: Thunder Bluff for 80 silver.
  level 30
  money 80s
  train 5957                                  -- Birgitte Cranston: Teleport: Thunder Bluff

step Portals to Orgrimmar and the Undercity
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 40 the portal trainers teach the portals: a gateway your whole group can step through, for 1 gold 50 silver each. Each portal burns one Rune of Portals (20 silver at any reagent vendor). Thuul in Darkbriar Lodge has Portal: Orgrimmar; teleport to the Undercity for Lexington Mortaim's Portal: Undercity.
  level 40
  money 3g
  train 5958                                  -- Thuul: Portal: Orgrimmar
  buy 17032 x5 nearest                        -- Rune of Portals, 20s each
  train 2492                                  -- Lexington Mortaim, Undercity: Portal: Undercity

step Portal: Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 50 Birgitte Cranston, down in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise in Thunder Bluff, teaches the last one, Portal: Thunder Bluff, for 3 gold 20 silver. Use your Teleport: Thunder Bluff to get there.
  level 50
  money 3g20s
  train 5957                                  -- Birgitte Cranston: Portal: Thunder Bluff
